"""金声玉振 — the score. Opens with a bronze bell, closes with a stone chime. 168 s, 48 kHz stereo.
Gong mode on D with the raised fourth of the court scale (雅乐音阶: D E F# G# A B C#)."""
import sys, os, json, time, numpy as np, soundfile as sfile
